{"ts":1793393465597,"event":"done","summary":"PLAT-103 shipped: validateApp now requires owner (@mfe/shared-contracts 2.0.0, breaking, published by CD). Adopted in billing (payments), core-shell (platform), and reports (insights), each passing owner from package.json team and bumped to ^2.0.0; all merged and CD green. Assumptions: owner is hardcoded in each app's src (bundles cannot read package.json at runtime, and the build only inlines named imports); reports was not in the breakdown but calls validateApp, so I included it under the acceptance criterion; platformkit has no validateApp callers. Empty-string owner is rejected; whitespace-only is not trimmed."}
